        <mxCell id="rules" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fillColor=#fad9d5;strokeColor=#ae4132;spacing=10;fontSize=11;" value="&lt;b&gt;Assumptions&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Only the host device plays audio&lt;br&gt;• Host can always override a verdict&lt;br&gt;• Unknown songs or AI errors → review&lt;br&gt;• Only allow / review / block are accepted&lt;br&gt;• Verdicts cached per song + occasion&lt;br&gt;• Room ends: host ends it, host gone &amp;gt; 10 min,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;1 h inactivity, or 24 h max" vertex="1">
